    <!--
        Starter manifest for pulling the Login.gov CRM data model and app
        config out of the gsa-peo sandbox with the Salesforce CLI:

            sf project retrieve start -x manifest/package.xml -o gsa-peo

        Add members/types as the app grows (new custom objects, flows,
        permission sets, etc.). Members are listed explicitly rather than
        with wildcards ("*") because this sandbox hosts several unrelated
        apps (e.g. FCIC) that share these metadata types - a wildcard here
        would pull in components with no relation to the LDGCRM app.
    -->
